{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_pianst_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_pianst_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "夕陽與朝日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pianst_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "98024a37ee90327adb8ea30306d9ac9028ef58d7b7db04b09ba401b5d23d0798",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你又來送藥給車爾尼先生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，車爾尼先生人不壞，只是，要是他能記得按時接受治療就更好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，希望他能更愛惜自己的身體一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這樣又覺得就不像他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先忙去了，等下一起吃午餐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，我要進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "門內的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "根據過去的經驗，這種時候她往往得不到回應，以至於她不得不採取一些強制措施——比如專門申請了一把車爾尼宿舍的備用鑰匙卡。\n但今天車爾尼似乎並沒有過去那麼忘我，宿舍的自動門在他的回應後立刻被打開了。\n怎麼了？\n帶著這樣的懷疑，她走入車爾尼的宿舍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雜亂擺放的樂譜、各色各樣的即溶咖啡包裝、源石技藝研究相關的書籍，以及一個在這堆東西之間眉頭緊鎖的埃拉菲亞。\n車爾尼的宿舍裡，總是這樣的光景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大部分時候，這一幕意味著他正在進行創作，而這種狀態下的他，沒有人能夠打擾。\n——基本上，醫療部的幾位常駐醫生都進行過各自的嘗試。\n不過，今天的狀況似乎有些不同，他的面前並沒有樂譜，他看起來並沒有在忙著創作。\n這反而讓她有些生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，如果您沒有在忙著您的創作的話，我希望您能夠記得來醫療部體檢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要把例外當成理所當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你來得正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來得當然正好，畢竟您這個脾氣也不是一天兩天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我要在羅德島開一個鋼琴班招收一些學生，我該怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？唔，去後勤部那邊填一下表格應該就好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，感謝你，我這就去一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？蛤？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？桌上這是什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去的體檢報告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，車爾尼先生，您還沒體檢呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒想到車爾尼先生開班的消息放出去後，會來這麼多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問車爾尼大師的鋼琴班是在這裡報名嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，這裡是隊尾，請在這裡等候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，前面隊伍已經排這麼長了嗎！我就叫你早點起來，這孩子，就是不聽話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "排斥的孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽媽，我不想學鋼琴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位可是萊塔尼亞的名家，錯過這個機會，下次就沒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是你的好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "排斥的孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，我聽說車爾尼大師不好相處，請問有什麼需要我注意的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，關於這點請不用太擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生來到羅德島之後，脾氣相較過去已經好了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站直，立正，調整好表情，進去之後好好表現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "排斥的孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，車爾尼先生在維多利亞也很有名氣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你不是他的助手嗎？這都不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉，我是他的醫生，只是怕他出事，所以才來幫忙維持秩序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，醫生，那你看來對音樂了解不深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生的《晨暮》，即使在維多利亞的貴族圈子裡，也是廣為傳播的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，真沒想到，我光知道車爾尼先生也來了羅德島治病，原以為最多聽他彈奏一曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說這位大師性情非常古怪，沒想到他竟然願意開班。醫生，你知道是為什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是車爾尼先生想要換一換心情吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，也許吧。反正，這一趟回去，不知道有多少太太要羨慕我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼大師，您怎麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉，我突然有些急事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，等等呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低聲）他的表情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉，先生，請在這裡等候，我去看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "芙蓉本以為車爾尼的身體出現了問題，於是緊緊跟在他的身後。\n卻沒想到，車爾尼並沒有回宿舍，而是轉彎走進了一間訓練室。\n而在訓練室裡，他找到一個沙袋，狠狠地開始了擊打。\n看來，車爾尼比她想像的要有精神得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個貴族，那個貴族不停地在我耳邊說著他對音樂那粗淺的認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他難道不知道，因為他的自以為是，他的孩子被迫接受了多少錯誤的認知嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音樂怎麼可能是那樣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的孩子對音樂的排斥完全是因為他本人的膚淺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一個人也是！再上一個——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那個人倒是還好，只是希望自己的孩子能受一點音樂方面的薰陶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你怎麼來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為您身體不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，如你所見，我只是在稍微發洩一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還在萊塔尼亞的時候，我就經常要見一些這樣的貴族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們透過格特魯德把自己的孩子送到我的面前，希望我能教授他們的孩子成為一名鋼琴大師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然可以教，但是，他們之中大部分並不是真的希望自己的孩子成為一個鋼琴家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們希望藉由這種方式邀請我為他們演奏，或者和格特魯德搭上話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而即使是真的希望孩子成材的，也不過是希望他們孩子的音樂技藝能夠符合作為貴族的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他們的孩子也大多被他們教育得呆板或者勢利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每當遇到這樣的組合，我就會無法忍受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還要謝謝你推薦我多運動健身，它的發洩效果還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "車爾尼指了指沙袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並不是所有人都能做到像您這麼純粹的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然能夠理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在夕照區，也會有鄰居希望我能教他們的孩子鋼琴，只是為了當做一門手藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，倒不如說，大部分人都是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但和貴族們相比，他們至少是可愛的，所以，我始終更喜歡夕照區的氛圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人們可以欺騙我，但是，在面對音樂時，他們應當保持誠實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要是這麼不喜歡這些慕名而來的貴族，要不然還是不要開這個班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們醫療部也擔心您的身體——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須開這個班，這是我必須克服的障礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您實在不太願意應付那些監護人，我可以去和那些監護人談一談，讓他們只把孩子送進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並且，您未來的課程中，也謝絕監護人的陪伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣應該能減輕一些您的負擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！這個辦法不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這麼辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，到體檢的時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉醫生，您找車爾尼大師嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大師他似乎去上課了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，現在應該不是鋼琴課的時間吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不是鋼琴課，聽我家孩子說，他好像最近經常去上海帕提婭老師的歷史課。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？我去看一看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，等等，芙蓉醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是車爾尼大師的主治醫師，您應該在他那裡說得上話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些話，我想和您聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，您先說說看吧，我不保證幫得上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了。是這樣的，我聽我的孩子說，她有些跟不上車爾尼大師上課的節奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，別的監護人也多少從他們的孩子那裡收到了類似的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不願意讓我們進入課堂，我們可以理解，但是，您看，關於上課的節奏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我不是說要大師改變自己的步調，只不過，是否有可能稍微進行一些調整呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……孩子們都這麼想嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，至少我家的孩子是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會去和他聊一聊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，好的，太感謝您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，今天的課程就到此為止了，我的代課也到此結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海帕提婭老師下節課就回來了，大家可以期待一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學生們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝真理老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝真理老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真理，這到底是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我想問的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前幾天，車爾尼先生忽然出現在了歷史課的課堂上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海帕提婭老師原本以為他只是開玩笑的，結果他非常認真地聽起了課，還很認真地做了筆記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "課堂本就歡迎所有學生，我們也就隨他來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在學生提問的時候，應該用引導的方式，而不是直接否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重要的不是立刻理解，而是創造理解的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這節課也很有價值，非常好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，您什麼時候這麼好學了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是來學習怎麼上課的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我發現，這是一個大麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以為，指導學生就像指導黑鍵和白堊那樣，並沒有那麼困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要他們能夠跟上我的演奏，只要他們能夠體會一場演奏中的奧妙，他們的能力自然能夠進步——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實許多人並不能做到這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我覺得，這應該是很正常的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不否認這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這對我來說就成了一個難題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當他們向我提出一個又一個的問題時，我不知道該怎麼去回答他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些問題，我甚至覺得不應該被問出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我來說，問出那些問題就意味著，他們從一開始就沒有入門，就沒有理解音樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，所以您來這裡上課，是為了學習怎麼教別人學習？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在深有體會，教育也是一件超級深奧的事情啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您還真是……熱衷於這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，為什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，抱歉，芙蓉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去上課了，體檢可以等到上完課嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生的鋼琴班已經開了一段時間了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多帶了孩子的病人都把自己的孩子送了過去，甚至有的人自己都報名了，我們一些同事都去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種時候才意識到，車爾尼先生的影響力可真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你怎麼了，心不在焉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我在想，車爾尼先生為什麼會想要開這個鋼琴班呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像他這樣的人，音樂成就已經幾乎走到巔峰了，想要收幾個學生也是理所當然的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的音樂成就已經走到巔峰了……嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的曲子已經被許多人瞭解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說，連萊塔尼亞的雙子女皇都對他的樂曲讚美有加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我記得你之前提到過，他在夕照區的事件中，甚至與那位巫王的殘響鬥爭過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣他都活了下來，他還能追求什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我是他，我也想開個班賺賺錢，平平穩穩地過日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不覺得車爾尼先生是那樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他是什麼樣的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是那種，直到生命的盡頭都會探索音樂邊界的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們正是因為尊重這樣的人，所以才會為他們破一些例，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也對，不然早就把他綁到醫療部來接受治療了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這樣的人，現在卻……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，太好了，你在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "有品味的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽我家的孩子說，車爾尼大師今天沒來上課，大師是不是身體狀況欠佳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請等一等，我去看一看他的狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，車爾尼先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我要進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一打開房門，撲面而來的聲浪差點將芙蓉淹沒，想必在她開門之前，它們已經在房間裡盤旋了很久。\n而且，這不是車爾尼的音樂，這些音樂即使是她這個門外漢都能辨認出十分稚嫩。\n這應該是他學生們的演奏。\n而這些演奏此時無序地交錯著，給本就混亂的房間更添一絲混沌。\n芙蓉一直以來對房間的雜亂頗有微詞，但此時，最讓她揪心的，是倒在房間中央的那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會這樣？！之前的體檢明明指標都是穩定的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倒下的車爾尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？唔……現在幾點了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倒下的車爾尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？糟了，來不及上課了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，芙蓉，抱歉，我好像睡過頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是來催我上課的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不，我是來看您有沒有死了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那你可以放心，在教出滿意的學生之前，我沒打算死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您昨晚在幹什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你聽這些音樂，這都是學生們的作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想找到他們每個人的特質，然後為他們設計一些更符合他們的課程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼啊……最近確實有些睡眠不足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一個疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所認識的車爾尼先生，是一個胸中永遠充滿了音樂熱情的音樂家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在，您突然把所有精力放在了教授學生的事情上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實說，我有些害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為您的表現簡直就像那些即將放棄生命的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不求未來，只想找到一個自己的接班人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是醫生，我比其他人更了解礦石病的痛苦，我不會要求您一定要樂觀面對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，您來到了羅德島，您應該相信我們，應該和我們一起面對這個挑戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，首先，你說誰放棄了求生的欲望？我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，你以為我放棄了求生意志，拼命地想找個接班人，然後迎接自己的死亡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我表現得像是那樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一點我並不否認，芙蓉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我為夕照區的人們演奏時，我時而暢想，我會踏上更遠的土地，被更多的人圍繞，為他們帶去動聽的音樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，當我看到我的體檢報告時，我從未如此清楚地知道，我沒有辦法走那麼遠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不詛咒命運。即使沒有這一身礦石病，總有一天我也會死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在那之前，我已經經歷過音樂生涯的巔峰，我比大多人都要幸運了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我當然不滿足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想走得更遠，我想聽得更多，我想創作得更久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我才會開這個班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，您不是因為失去了求生欲而選擇開班，而是因為想要繼續下去而開班？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個說法——也不盡然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很難有條理地向你解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "車爾尼沉默了一會兒，走到窗邊，指著遠處的一座山峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那我這麼說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像這片大地上的其他諸多事業一樣，音樂是一座永遠看不到頂點的高峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的宿命，就是攀登它，直到生命的最後一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我當然做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算沒有這一身礦石病，總有一天，我也會走下山峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，不要認為這是悲涼的，這是認命的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些受過我引導的孩子，他們會踏上我曾走過的路，抵達我曾經抵達的位置，然後向著山峰的更高處挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望這樣去做，就如同我諸多的老師們，我老師們的老師們那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們，不，我們在教導的過程中，想的並不是我的生命到此為止了，而是我的生命將在音樂中延續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為，在我們拄著拐杖走下山峰的同時，那些興高采烈地踏上征服音樂之路的孩子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同樣是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正如太陽，它每時每刻都是夕陽，卻也每時每刻都是朝日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦對了，說到這個，我這兩天其實是在寫一份東西，正好請你幫我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "車爾尼說著，從雜亂的文件堆裡翻出一疊紙，遞給芙蓉。\n芙蓉立刻就被標題吸引了注意——“研究經費申請書”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對一個萊塔尼亞人，尤其是對我來說，將音樂和源石技藝結合在一起是一件理所當然的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但對其他國家的人來說，這一點並不那麼容易理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認真剖析了這一點，覺得它大有可為，所以為此寫了一份經費申請書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何，這樣應該能讓你放心吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……怎麼可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然您看起來依然充滿活力，但是，無論過去還是現在，您可都不怎麼關心自己的身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您真的想要教出一些好學生，那麼，為了那些學生，您也應該更加愛惜身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不得不說，這是我聽過的最有說服力的醫囑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，您可以把這份文件交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，您該去上課了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不行，芙蓉，能不能請你去和我的學生們說一聲，今天的課延後一個小時？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能以這樣的面貌去見我的學生們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要整理儀容一下，而且手部的保養也還沒有做，需要一些時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……好吧，就聽您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
